    "model": "Going from aluminium to chlorine, the nuclear charge (number of protons) increases.\nThe extra electrons enter the same outer shell, with the same inner shells, so the screening (shielding) is unchanged.\nThe increased nuclear charge is effective, so it pulls the outer electrons closer and the atomic radius decreases.",
