    "model": "For one mole of ethyne (C₂H₂):\n\nCombustion equation: 2C₂H₂ + 5O₂ → 4CO₂ + 2H₂O\n\nFrom the equation, 2 moles of ethyne require 5 moles of oxygen.\n\nFor 1 mole of ethyne: moles of O₂ = 5/2 = **2.5 moles of oxygen used**\n\nFrom the equation, 2 moles of ethyne produce 2 moles of water.\n\nFor 1 mole of ethyne: moles of H₂O = 2/2 = **1 mole of water produced**",
