    "marks": 15,
    "model": "1. Rinse the burette with deionised water, then rinse it with a small amount of the EDTA reagent to remove the water.\n2. Clamp the burette vertically.\n3. Use a funnel to fill the burette with EDTA reagent, then remove the funnel before reading.\n4. Open the tap to fill the part of the burette below the tap and remove any air bubbles.\n5. Read the bottom of the meniscus at eye level, with the meniscus set on the zero mark.",
