    "label": "(c)",
    "marks": 6,
    "model": "Solution: a buffer solution (an ammonia/ammonium chloride buffer).\nPurpose: it keeps the pH high (above 9, about 10) so that the EDTA complex forms correctly and the indicator gives a sharp end point.",
