    "model": "Molar mass of HCl = 36.5 g/mol. Mass of HCl in 2.5 litres: 36% (w/v) means 36 g per 100 cm³. In 2500 cm³: (36 ÷ 100) × 2500 = 900 g HCl. Moles = 900 ÷ 36.5 = 24.7 mol (or 24.66 mol)",
    "model_source": "audited",
