    "model": "Type of crystal: covalent molecular crystal.\n\nBinding forces: van der Waals (London/dispersion or dipole-dipole) forces hold the I2 molecules together in the crystal. The atoms within each I2 molecule are joined by strong covalent bonds, but the forces between molecules are weak.",
