    "label": "(d)(i)",
    "marks": 6,
    "model": "Na₂CO₃ + 2HCl → 2NaCl + CO₂ + H₂O, so mole ratio Na₂CO₃ : HCl = 1 : 2\n(V₁M₁)/n₁ = (V₂M₂)/n₂\n(25.0 × X)/1 = (26.05 × 0.11)/2\nX = 0.0573 mol l⁻¹ (0.0573 M)",
