    "model": "Read the total volume from the flat part of the graph: 78.0 cm³ of gas at room temperature and pressure (RTP).\nThe gas is oxygen, O₂ (M = 32 g mol⁻¹).\nMoles of O₂ = volume ÷ molar volume = 78.0 cm³ ÷ 24 000 cm³ mol⁻¹ = 3.25 × 10⁻³ mol\nMass of O₂ = moles × M = 3.25 × 10⁻³ mol × 32 g mol⁻¹ = 0.104 g\nTotal mass of gas produced ≈ 0.104 g (about 0.10 g).",
