    "marks": 6.25,
    "model": "For the equilibrium 2SO₂ + O₂ ⇌ 2SO₃, the equilibrium constant expression is: Kc = [SO₃]²/([SO₂]²[O₂]). The concentrations of products appear in the numerator and those of reactants in the denominator, each raised to the power of their stoichiometric coefficients.",
