    "model": "Mᵣ of Mg₂Si = (2 × 24) + 28 = 76\nMoles of Mg₂Si = 7.6 g ÷ 76 g mol⁻¹ = 0.10 mol\nFrom SiO₂ + 4Mg → Mg₂Si + 2MgO, 4 mol Mg give 1 mol Mg₂Si\nMoles of Mg = 4 × 0.10 = 0.4 mol\nAnswer: 0.4 mol of magnesium",
