    "model": "Sulfuric acid (dibasic):\npH = 2.0, so [H⁺] = 10⁻² = 0.01 M\nEach H₂SO₄ gives 2 H⁺, so [H₂SO₄] = 0.01 ÷ 2 = 0.005 M\n\nWeak monobasic acid HA:\n[H⁺] = [A⁻] = 0.01 M\nKₐ = [H⁺][A⁻] / [HA] = [H⁺]² / [HA]\n1.8 × 10⁻⁴ = (0.01)² / [HA]\n[HA] = 1 × 10⁻⁴ ÷ 1.8 × 10⁻⁴ = 5/9 = 0.556 M",
