    "model": "Increasing the volume decreases the pressure, so the system opposes this change by shifting to the side with more moles (molecules) of gas.\nThe right-hand side (forward reaction) is favoured: N₂O₄ ⇌ 2NO₂ has 1 mole on the left and 2 moles on the right.\nThe forward reaction is favoured, so more NO₂ forms (and the mixture is darker).",
